# name: 内置规则集 DNS
# source: projected-from-rules
# policy: SYSTEM = resolve via system/local DNS (rule page wins)
#
# Pair with builtin-ruleset.list (same stem).
# Only list domains that also appear as DOMAIN / DOMAIN-SUFFIX / DOMAIN-KEYWORD
# in the routing .list — type + payload must match.

# 内网 / 本机（示例，可按需增删）
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,local,SYSTEM
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,localhost,SYSTEM
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xiaojukeji.com,SYSTEM

# 国内常见（与 .list 中 DIRECT 条目对应时才会生效）
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,baidu.com,SYSTEM
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,taobao.com,SYSTEM
